---
import MainLayout from "../layouts/MainLayout.astro";
---

<MainLayout
    title="AutoTest - Certificación Vial Profesional"
    description="Plataforma líder para la preparación del examen teórico de conducir. Métricas avanzadas, banco de preguntas oficial y análisis técnico de rendimiento."
>
    <!-- Hero Section -->
    <section class="relative text-center py-20 lg:py-32 mb-16 overflow-hidden">
        <div
            class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 bg-[radial-gradient(#e5e7eb_1px,transparent_1px)] dark:bg-[radial-gradient(#1f2937_1px,transparent_1px)] [background-size:40px_40px] [mask-image:radial-gradient(ellipse_50%_50%_at_50%_50%,#000_70%,transparent_100%)] opacity-20"
        >
        </div>
        <div class="absolute inset-0 -z-10 overflow-hidden">
            <div
                class="absolute -top-[10%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 w-[600px] h-[600px] bg-blue-400/20 dark:bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full filter blur-[120px] animate-pulse"
            >
            </div>
            <div
                class="absolute top-1/4 -left-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-cyan-400/20 dark:bg-cyan-600/10 rounded-full filter blur-[100px] animate-blob"
            >
            </div>
            <div
                class="absolute bottom-1/4 -right-1/4 w-96 h-96 bg-blue-400/20 dark:bg-blue-600/10 rounded-full filter blur-[100px] animate-blob animation-delay-4000"
            >
            </div>
        </div>

        <div
            class="inline-flex items-center px-5 py-2.5 rounded-full bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/20 text-blue-700 dark:text-blue-300 text-xs font-black uppercase tracking-widest mb-10 border border-blue-100 dark:border-blue-800/30"
        >
            <svg
                class="w-4 h-4 mr-2"
                fill="none"
                stroke="currentColor"
                viewBox="0 0 24 24"
            >
                <path
                    stroke-linecap="round"
                    stroke-linejoin="round"
                    stroke-width="2.5"
                    d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04M12 2.944a11.952 11.952 0 00-6.812 4.411m13.624 0A11.952 11.952 0 0012 2.944M2.957 10.469a11.952 11.952 0 003.451 8.3m11.182 0a11.952 11.952 0 003.451-8.3m-12.734 0a11.952 11.952 0 003.078 0m9.984 0a11.952 11.952 0 00-3.078 0M8 8.483V7a1 1 0 012 0v1.517a1 1 0 001 1h2a1 1 0 001-1V7a1 1 0 012 0v1.483a1 1 0 00.551.894l2 1a1 1 0 01.373 1.48l-2 3A1 1 0 0115 15H9a1 1 0 01-.924-.618l-2-3.5a1 1 0 011.373-1.48l2 1a1 1 0 00.551-.894z"
                ></path>
            </svg>
            Sistemas de Evaluación Homologados
        </div>

        <h1
            class="text-4xl sm:text-6xl lg:text-8xl font-black mb-8 leading-tight tracking-tighter"
        >
            <span class="text-gray-900 dark:text-white">Excelencia en</span>
            <br />
            <span
                class="bg-gradient-to-r from-blue-600 to-cyan-500 bg-clip-text text-transparent"
            >
                Formación Vial
            </span>
        </h1>

        <p
            class="text-base sm:text-xl text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 mb-14 max-w-2xl mx-auto font-medium leading-relaxed"
        >
            Plataforma técnica de alto rendimiento diseñada para profesionales.
            Algoritmos de aprendizaje adaptativo y analítica en tiempo real.
        </p>

        <div
            class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row gap-6 justify-center items-center"
        >
            <a
                href="/tests/"
                class="group relative inline-flex items-center px-10 py-5 bg-gray-900 dark:bg-white text-white dark:text-gray-900 rounded-2xl transition-all duration-300 font-bold text-lg shadow-2xl hover:scale-105 active:scale-95 overflow-hidden"
            >
                <span class="relative z-10 flex items-center">
                    COMENZAR EVALUACIÓN
                    <svg
                        class="w-5 h-5 ml-3 group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-transform"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        ><path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2.5"
                            d="M14 5l7 7m0 0l-7 7m7-7H3"></path></svg
                    >
                </span>
            </a>
            <a
                href="/nosotros/"
                class="inline-flex items-center px-10 py-5 bg-white dark:bg-gray-800/50 text-gray-900 dark:text-white rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:bg-gray-50 dark:hover:bg-gray-800 transition-all font-bold text-lg"
            >
                Saber Más
            </a>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Estadísticas -->
    <section
        class="relative py-12 px-6 sm:px-8 bg-white dark:bg-gray-900 rounded-3xl sm:rounded-[2.5rem] border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-800 shadow-sm mb-24 overflow-hidden"
    >
        <div
            class="grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-4 gap-8 md:gap-12 max-w-6xl mx-auto relative z-10"
        >
            <div class="text-center">
                <div
                    class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1"
                >
                    Activos Disponibles
                </div>
                <div
                    class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tighter"
                >
                    3,000+
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <div
                    class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1"
                >
                    Categorías
                </div>
                <div
                    class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tighter"
                >
                    5
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <div
                    class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1"
                >
                    Módulos de Test
                </div>
                <div
                    class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tighter"
                >
                    50+
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="text-center">
                <div
                    class="text-[10px] font-black text-gray-400 uppercase tracking-widest mb-1"
                >
                    Uptime de Red
                </div>
                <div class="text-4xl font-black text-blue-600 tracking-tighter">
                    99.9%
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>

    <!-- Características principales -->
    <section class="mb-24">
        <div
            class="flex flex-col md:flex-row justify-between items-end mb-16 gap-6"
        >
            <div class="max-w-xl">
                <h2
                    class="text-4xl font-black text-gray-900 dark:text-white tracking-tight mb-4 uppercase"
                >
                    Estándares Profesionales
                </h2>
                <p class="text-gray-500 font-medium">
                    AutoTest integra las metodologías más avanzadas para
                    garantizar el éxito académico.
                </p>
            </div>
            <div class="hidden md:block w-24 h-px bg-gray-200 dark:bg-gray-800">
            </div>
        </div>

        <div class="grid md:grid-cols-3 gap-8">
            <div
                class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-blue-500/30 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-blue-500/5"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-14 h-14 bg-blue-50 dark:bg-blue-900/30 rounded-2xl items-center justify-center flex mb-8 text-blue-600 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                >
                    <svg
                        class="w-7 h-7"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        ><path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2.5"
                            d="M13 10V3L4 14h7v7l9-11h-7z"></path></svg
                    >
                </div>
                <h3
                    class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight"
                >
                    Instantaneidad
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-medium leading-relaxed"
                >
                    Sistemas de validación en milisegundos. Obtenga
                    retroalimentación técnica inmediata tras cada interacción.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div
                class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-cyan-500/30 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-cyan-500/5"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-14 h-14 bg-cyan-50 dark:bg-cyan-900/30 rounded-2xl items-center justify-center flex mb-8 text-cyan-600 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                >
                    <svg
                        class="w-7 h-7"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        ><path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2.5"
                            d="M9 19v-6a2 2 0 00-2-2H5a2 2 0 00-2 2v6a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2zm0 0V9a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v10m-6 0a2 2 0 002 2h2a2 2 0 002-2m0 0V5a2 2 0 012-2h2a2 2 0 012 2v14a2 2 0 01-2 2h-2a2 2 0 01-2-2z"
                        ></path></svg
                    >
                </div>
                <h3
                    class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight"
                >
                    Analítica
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-medium leading-relaxed"
                >
                    Desglose detallado de competencias por área temática.
                    Identificación predictiva de patrones de error.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div
                class="group bg-white dark:bg-gray-800 p-10 rounded-[2.5rem] border border-gray-100 dark:border-gray-700 hover:border-purple-500/30 transition-all duration-500 hover:shadow-2xl hover:shadow-purple-500/5"
            >
                <div
                    class="w-14 h-14 bg-purple-50 dark:bg-purple-900/20 rounded-2xl items-center justify-center flex mb-8 text-purple-600 group-hover:scale-110 transition-transform"
                >
                    <svg
                        class="w-7 h-7"
                        fill="none"
                        stroke="currentColor"
                        viewBox="0 0 24 24"
                        ><path
                            stroke-linecap="round"
                            stroke-linejoin="round"
                            stroke-width="2.5"
                            d="M12 6.253v13m0-13C10.832 5.477 9.246 5 7.5 5S4.168 5.477 3 6.253v13C4.168 18.477 5.754 18 7.5 18s3.332.477 4.5 1.253m0-13C13.168 5.477 14.754 5 16.5 5c1.746 0 3.332.477 4.5 1.253v13C19.832 18.477 18.246 18 16.5 18c-1.746 0-3.332.477-4.5 1.253"
                        ></path></svg
                    >
                </div>
                <h3
                    class="text-2xl font-black mb-4 text-gray-900 dark:text-white uppercase tracking-tight"
                >
                    Integridad
                </h3>
                <p
                    class="text-gray-500 dark:text-gray-400 font-medium leading-relaxed"
                >
                    Sincronización continua con bases de datos oficiales.
                    Cumplimiento estricto de normativas vigentes.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </section>
</MainLayout>
